Rob Hooft wrote:
> 
>
> 
>  >> Our keyboard doesn't have seperate ESCAPE key but on top left
>  [..]
>  >> Does anybody know how to do it?
> 

Put this in your .xsession :

# Modify keymap so that F11 translates to Escape (if we don't have an
# Escape already).
if  xmodmap -pk | grep -q Escape
then
    : # we have an Escape key, great.
    echo This keyboard has an Escape
else
    echo Mapping F11 to Escape
    xmodmap -e 'keysym F11 = Escape'
fi



Good luck,
Bob
